BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:dd3bb902036bfa885cf4d6a2@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260820T194503Z
SUMMARY:FREE ARTIST AND CAREER BUILDING WORKSHOP FOR MUSICIANS
LOCATION:The Music Village | 333 S Michigan St | South Bend\, IN 46601
DESCRIPTION:Interested in artist development or building a career in music?
  This workshop is for you!\n\nPresented by The Music Village and Jireh Mu
 sic - open to all ages\, all instruments\, and all playing levels.\n\nThi
 s FREE 60 minute workshop offers musicians a rare chance to learn from an
 d interact with a chart-topping music industry professional. Led by drumm
 er\, composer\, and Billboard Top 40 recording artist\, Travis Brant\, th
 is engaging workshop transforms the art of musical creativity into practi
 cal\, easy-to-use skills that inspire and equip musicians at every level.
 \n\nDiscussion topics include Building Foundations (mastering fundamental
 s\, practice routine\, listening skills\, musical roles)\, Career Buildin
 g (how to become a professional\, networking\, habits of the pros\, caree
 r options in music)\, Artist Development (music business\, writing / reco
 rding / releasing music) and time for Q&A.\n\nExpand your skills\, gain k
 nowledge\, learn about the music business\, careers in music\, and much m
 ore!\n\nThe Music Village is a community musical arts center and school\,
  celebrating music and cultural expressions rooted in the traditions of d
 iverse local and global communities in the heart of downtown South Bend\,
  Indiana.\n\nJireh Music is a nonprofit music program providing artist an
 d career development through education\, mentoring\, and support resource
 s.\n\nTravis Brant is an American drummer\, composer\, co-founder of the 
 band Axon Radio\, and Billboard / Mediabase top 40 recording artist. Trav
 is' recorded works include collaborations with contemporary jazz icons Ge
 rald Albright\, Michael Lington\, Darren Rahn\, Paul Brown\, fusion guita
 rist Oz Noy\, and more.\n\nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/even
 ts/free-artist-and-career-building-workshop-for-musicians/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/free-artist-and-career-building-w
 orkshop-for-musicians/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260822T150000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
