BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:320fccbf363fb0176314e73b@visitsouthbend.com
DTSTAMP:20260820T194503Z
SUMMARY:OLDTIME DANCING
LOCATION:Pinhook Park Community Building | 2801 Riverside Dr. | South Bend\
 , IN 46616
DESCRIPTION:Come out for an evening of dancing fun! No experience necessary
 \, all ages welcome! Please join us on Friday\, August 21st for the first
  dance of our new year! Contra longlines\, circles\, squares\, waltzes\, 
 and couple mixers. All dances taught before calling. No partner necessary
 . Lisa Sutton is calling and our band will be Impromptunes. The Impromptu
 nes are Peter Martin (hammered dulcimer/flutes)\, Laurie Eberhardt (piano
 ) and Rania Adamczyk (fiddle).\n\nCost: $8.00/regular\; $5.00/student and
  unwaged\; $4.00 under 12\; $20/family. Those on limited incomes can pay 
 what they feel they can afford. You pay at the door\; cash only please.\n
 \nMore Info: https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/oldtime-dancing/
URL:https://www.visitsouthbend.com/events/oldtime-dancing/
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260821T213000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
